<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>System Prompts</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide system prompt used for conversation agent in Fig. <a href="#A7.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix G System Prompts ‣ The Alignment Waltz: Jointly Training Agents to Collaborate for Safety" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and the system prompt used for feedback agent in Fig. <a href="#A7.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix G System Prompts ‣ The Alignment Waltz: Jointly Training Agents to Collaborate for Safety" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
